	Callisto 2.0 — redesigned
	  • Sidebar navigation, rounded cards, soft violet→blue accent
	  • CanvasGroup based fades (no more Fader cache)
	  • New: Notify, Descriptions, Divider, Paragraph, Progress, Segmented,
	         categories + page icons, hex input in colorpicker, config export/import
	Public API is backwards compatible with the old version.
]]

